WEBVTT

00:00.654 --> 00:02.696
&lt;i>Previously on:&lt;/i>

00:02.767 --> 00:04.233
So, what happened
between you and your girl?

00:04.235 --> 00:07.102
She wanted to get married, and
I'm just not sure I'm ready.

00:07.104 --> 00:08.604
That's the same reason
I lost Lyndsey.

00:08.606 --> 00:10.973
You got to get her back.
Don't make the same mistake I did.

00:10.975 --> 00:13.542
I am gonna ask Lyndsey
to marry me.

00:13.544 --> 00:16.478
Yeah, I just have to get a ring.
I got a ring you could have.

00:16.480 --> 00:18.514
You must be here
to see your friend Larry,

00:18.516 --> 00:20.182
who is also here.

00:20.951 --> 00:24.186
Lyndsey MacElroy,
will you marry me?

00:24.188 --> 00:26.388
Yes, I will marry you!

00:26.390 --> 00:28.958
(Lyndsey laughing)

00:31.861 --> 00:33.596
What's going on down here?

00:33.598 --> 00:35.898
I got up to pee
and I heard moaning.

00:35.900 --> 00:37.399
