00:37.401 --> 00:40.269
(woman moans sensually on TV)

00:40.271 --> 00:42.671
And moaning.

00:42.673 --> 00:45.040
You're watching porn
at 3:00 in the morning?

00:45.042 --> 00:46.809
No, it's that
soft-core flick

00:46.811 --> 00:49.011
that Lyndsey made
back in the '90s,

00:49.013 --> 00:51.280
&lt;i>Cinnamon's Buns.&lt;/i>

00:51.282 --> 00:54.817
Nothing brings me back
like hearing her fake an orgasm.

00:54.819 --> 00:57.586
Oh, listen, I know
that breakups are hard, but...

00:57.588 --> 01:00.422
