those were for crying.

01:01.291 --> 01:02.458
Oh, yes, yes, uh, yes.

01:02.460 --> 01:05.060
Uh, uh, crying, yes,
very upset, very upset, yes.

01:05.062 --> 01:08.464
Wow, you know, you're
a classy guy, Alan.

01:08.466 --> 01:10.399
