01:12.136 --> 01:14.903
Technically, I never
actually proposed.

01:14.905 --> 01:15.856
What?

01:15.881 --> 01:17.841
Well, when I got there
he was already doing it,

01:17.842 --> 01:21.076
so I just figured I'd chalk
this one up as another loss

01:21.078 --> 01:22.478
and move on.

01:22.480 --> 01:25.314
Universe: 82,223;

01:25.316 --> 01:27.082
Alan: 12.

01:27.084 --> 01:28.951
Come on, you're exaggerating.

01:28.953 --> 01:31.253
You have not had 12 victories.

01:31.255 --> 01:32.955
Yes, I have.

01:32.957 --> 01:36.959
Uh, my son, plus the number of years
I've lived here rent-free.

01:36.961 --> 01:38.894
I can't believe
you just stood there

01:38.896 --> 01:40.996
