01:55.513 --> 01:57.713
Did he listen? No!

01:59.149 --> 02:01.984
No, the only reason Lyndsey
settled for Larry

02:01.986 --> 02:05.287
is 'cause she didn't know
she could settle for you!

02:05.289 --> 02:07.089
You're right. I mean,
you're a handsome billionaire,

02:07.091 --> 02:08.524
and &lt;i>you&lt;/i> settled for me.

02:09.459 --> 02:11.293
She's just a-a-a divorced,

02:11.295 --> 02:13.128
