02:14.097 --> 02:15.998
...of my dreams.

02:16.000 --> 02:18.667
That's the spirit!
Now, get up and...

02:18.669 --> 02:20.335
wash your hands and...

02:20.337 --> 02:22.204
burn this couch,
and go get your...

02:22.206 --> 02:24.373
surprisingly flexible
girlfriend back.

02:24.375 --> 02:26.241
You're right, you're right.
Thanks, Walden.

02:26.243 --> 02:27.976
LYNDSEY (on video):
Oh, Master Baker,

02:27.978 --> 02:31.180
