02:33.184 --> 02:36.051
Maybe one more scene.

02:36.053 --> 02:39.254
This is a pivotal
part of the film.

02:39.256 --> 02:41.390
You might need this.

02:42.459 --> 02:46.495
This scene's
a real tear... jerker.

02:46.497 --> 02:49.364
